### Test 1: Lista file (GET /api/v1/files)
# Verify: Status 200 OK. JSON response must contain your file_completed.pdf.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/files

### Test 2: Dettagli file (GET /api/v1/files/{id})
# Put your UUID!
# Verify: Status 200 OK. JSON response must contain details about your file.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/files/14c6d1a0-b51b-4e9b-a564-83b5ce50b9ea

### Test 3: Dettagli file INESISTENTE (GET /api/v1/files/{id})
# Verify: Status 404 Not Found.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/files/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Test 4: Download file (GET /api/v1/files/{id}/download)
# Put your UUID!
# Verify: Status 200 OK. IntelliJ should start the download of file_completed.pdf.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/files/09888c03-5566-48fe-97ef-2f6f896d0bc3/download

### Test 5: Modifica metadati (PATCH /api/v1/files/{id})
# Put your UUID!
# Verify: Status 200 OK. Check console for logging
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/files/14c6d1a0-b51b-4e9b-a564-83b5ce50b9ea
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filename": "UnityHubZipped.zip"
}

### Test 6: Cancella file (DELETE /api/v1/files/{id})
# Put your UUID!
# Verify: Status 204 No Content.
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/files/14c6d1a0-b51b-4e9b-a564-83b5ce50b9ea

### Test 7: Verifica Cancellazione (GET /api/v1/files/{id})
# Usa lo stesso UUID del Test 6!
# Verifica: Status 410 Gone.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/files/14c6d1a0-b51b-4e9b-a564-83b5ce50b9ea

